      <div style={{ fontSize: 8.5, color: "#98A2B3", marginTop: 6 }}>Distributed function: the Center Zone (CZM) acquires the six inputs (rear-view glare, ambient, reverse gear, ignition/power, driver HMI, vehicle speed) and arbitrates dimming, commanding the Y7.3 EC_Mirror over Center_Roof_LIN01. The Y7.3 (COTS smart mirror) reads glare/ambient, calculates the dim level and actuates the electrochromic glass, reporting status back. Reverse gear forces no-dim per FMVSS 111. The CZM block is clickable — open its requirements.</div>
